3.Update the rating of one restaurant and delete one restaurant record using a WHERE condition.
update restaurants 
set rating = 4.8 
where restaurant_id = 1; 


delete from restaurants 
where restaurant_id = 2; 


4.Write a SELECT query that retrieves all restaurants sorted by rating in descending order.
select*from restaurants 
order by rating desc;


